          {
            "title": "Use packages others created",
            "id": 151738,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aprendemos que um módulo é apenas um arquivo Python que pode ser compartilhado, importado e reutilizado. Vários módulos podem formar um pacote.</p><p>Podemos usar um pacote criado por outra pessoa. Vamos aprender a instalar e importar pacotes do Python para fazer isso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tabulate.tabulate(data))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"-----  --\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alice  25\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bob    30\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-----  --\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare code sources",
            "id": 151739,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O Python inclui muitos módulos úteis na biblioteca padrão, enquanto funcionalidades adicionais estão disponíveis por meio de pacotes de terceiros.</p><p>Python fornece pacotes, como <code>math</code>, <code>random</code> etc., que podemos usar para estender sua funcionalidade.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" random\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" math\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(random.randint(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(math.sqrt(\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"install\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4.0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>import</code> seguido de <code>import</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O Python inclui muitos módulos úteis na biblioteca padrão, enquanto funcionalidades adicionais estão disponíveis por meio de pacotes de terceiros.</p><p>Python fornece pacotes, como <code>math</code>, <code>random</code> etc., que podemos usar para estender sua funcionalidade.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" random\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" math\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(random.randint(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(math.sqrt(\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"from\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"install\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"randint\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4.0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>import</code> seguido de <code>import</code> e finalmente <code>sqrt</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare code sources - Copy",
            "id": 151765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos ampliar ainda mais a funcionalidade do Python com pacotes de terceiros criados por outros desenvolvedores, como <code>tabulate</code>.</p><p>Nós sempre usamos a mesma palavra-chave de importação. Complete a palavra-chave que importa o pacote de terceiros.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" random\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" math\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tabulate\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"install\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>import</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Read the error",
            "id": 151740,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao contrário dos módulos da biblioteca padrão, os pacotes de terceiros geralmente precisam ser instalados antes que você possa usá-los.<br /><br /></p><p><code>ModuleNotFoundError</code> geralmente significa que o Python não consegue encontrar o módulo solicitado. Apenas importá-lo não é suficiente neste caso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" random\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" math\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tabulate\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"install\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'tabulate'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>import</code> seguido de <code>tabulate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Use the command line",
            "id": 151766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>pip</strong> é o instalador de pacotes do Python. Na linha de comando, <code>pip</code> inicia esse instalador.</p><p>Complete a ferramenta de linha de comando mostrada aqui. Em seguida, você aprenderá o que <code>pip</code> faz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pip\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"import\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pip</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Meet pip",
            "id": 151743,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Instalar</strong> adiciona um pacote a um ambiente. Só então podemos importá-lo e disponibilizá-lo para um programa.</p><p>Depois de <code>pip</code>, escrevemos <code>install</code> para acionar o comando de instalação do gerenciador de pacotes.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pip install\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"import\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pip</code> seguido de <code>install</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the package name",
            "id": 151745,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em <code>pip install</code>, <code>pip</code> inicia o instalador e <code>install</code> informa que algo deve ser adicionado.</p><p>Um nome de pacote vem depois de <code>pip install</code>. Complete o nome do pacote <code>tabulate</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pip install tabulate\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"random\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Collecting tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Downloading tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Installing collected packages: tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Successfully installed tabulate\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>tabulate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O nome do pacote vem depois do comando de instalação.</p><p>Use o instalador para adicionar o pacote de formatação de tabelas <code>tabulate</code> ao ambiente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pip install tabulate\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"import\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"random\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tabulate.py\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Collecting tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Downloading tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Installing collected packages: tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Successfully installed tabulate\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pip</code> seguido de <code>install</code> e finalmente <code>tabulate</code>.</p></body></html>",
