      {
        "id": 17788,
        "title": "Usando arquivos de requisitos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Share the package list",
            "id": 151751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando o pip instala um pacote, ele adiciona o pacote ao ambiente ativo. Um ambiente é a configuração do Python usada atualmente para executar o código.</p><p>Um colega ou agente de programação usa outro ambiente. Sem os mesmos pacotes, o código não pode ser executado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vienna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Charlie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;London&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tabulate.tabulate(data, headers=[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Age&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;City&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Name       Age  City\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------  -----  ------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alice       25  Vienna\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bob         30  Berlin\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Charlie     28  London\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Share the package list - Copy",
            "id": 151781,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O Python oferece uma solução com <code>requirements.txt</code>, um arquivo de texto que lista os pacotes de que um projeto precisa.<br /></p><p>No arquivo <code>requirements.txt</code>, especificamos todos os pacotes de terceiros de que precisamos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"text\" name=\"requirements.txt\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tabulate\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"random\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>tabulate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Share the package list - Copy 2",
            "id": 151782,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada linha indica um pacote obrigatório. Podemos usar quantos forem necessários ou desejados.</p><p>Nós não listamos <code>random</code> nem <code>math</code> em <code>requirements.txt</code>, mesmo que os usemos, porque eles fazem parte da biblioteca padrão do Python.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"text\" name=\"requirements.txt\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"flask\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pandas\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"numpy\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
