            "id": 151755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assim como na instalação de um único pacote com <code>pip</code>, podemos instalar de uma só vez todos os pacotes listados em <code>requirements.txt</code>.</p><p>Comece com <code>pip install</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pip install\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"python\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pip</code> seguido de <code>install</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Read the full command",
            "id": 151756,
